   7:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @brief   This file provides firmware functions to manage the SYSCFG peripheral.
   8:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *
   9:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****  @verbatim
  10:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****     
  11:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****  ===============================================================================
  12:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  13:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****  ===============================================================================
  14:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****     [..] This driver provides functions for:
  15:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****             
  16:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****        (#) Remapping the memory accessible in the code area using SYSCFG_MemoryRemapConfig()
  17:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****             
  18:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****        (#) Swapping the internal flash Bank1 and Bank2 this features is only visible for 
  19:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****            STM32F42xxx/43xxx devices Devices. 
  20:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****                 
  21:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****        (#) Manage the EXTI lines connection to the GPIOs using SYSCFG_EXTILineConfig()
  22:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****               
  23:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****        (#) Select the ETHERNET media interface (RMII/RII) using SYSCFG_ETH_MediaInterfaceConfig()
  24:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   
  25:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****        -@- SYSCFG APB clock must be enabled to get write access to SYSCFG registers,
  26:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****            using RCC_APB2PeriphClockCmd(RCC_APB2Periph_SYSCFG, ENABLE);
  27:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****                    
  28:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****  @endverbatim      
