ARM GAS  /tmp/ccsyzcTX.s 			page 4


 113:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @param  SYSCFG_Memory: selects the memory remapping.
 114:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 115:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_Flash:       Main Flash memory mapped at 0x00000000  
 116:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_SystemFlash: System Flash memory mapped at 0x00000000
 117:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_FSMC:        FSMC (Bank1 (NOR/PSRAM 1 and 2) mapped at 0x000
 118:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_FMC:         FMC (Bank1 (NOR/PSRAM 1 and 2) mapped at 0x0000
 119:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_ExtMEM:      External Memory mapped at 0x00000000 for STM32F
 120:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_SRAM:        Embedded SRAM (112kB) mapped at 0x00000000
 121:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg SYSCFG_MemoryRemap_SDRAM:       FMC (External SDRAM)  mapped at 0x00000000 for 
 122:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @retval None
 123:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   */
