 132:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c **** /**
 133:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @brief  Enables or disables the Internal FLASH Bank Swapping.
 134:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *   
 135:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @note   This function can be used only for STM32F42xxx/43xxx devices. 
 136:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *
 137:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   * @param  NewState: new state of Internal FLASH Bank swapping.
 138:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 139:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg ENABLE: Flash Bank2 mapped at 0x08000000 (and aliased @0x00000000) 
 140:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *                         and Flash Bank1 mapped at 0x08100000 (and aliased at 0x00100000)   
 141:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****   *            @arg DISABLE:(the default state) Flash Bank1 mapped at 0x08000000 (and aliased @0x00
 142:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_syscfg.c ****                             and Flash Bank2 mapped at 0x08100000 (and aliased at 0x00100000)  
